---
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white text-[#0E1629]">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#F8FBFF_0%,#F6F7FA_45%,#E9EEF5_100%)]"></div>
	<div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#3353C1] via-[#DBB24D] to-[#3353C1]"></div>

	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:px-8">
		<div class="max-w-3xl">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-normal text-[#0E1629] sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.35rem]">
				Реални промишлени металдетекторни системи
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#334155]">
				Разгледайте снимки на промишлени металдетектори ЗЛАТ, транспортни системи, контролни възли и практически решения за металдетекция в производствени условия.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
				<a href="/contacts" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#3353C1] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white shadow-sm shadow-[#93A5DF]/60 transition hover:bg-[#1440BC]">
					Контакт със ЗЛАТ
				</a>
				<a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[#0E1629] transition hover:border-[#DBB24D] hover:text-[#1440BC]">
					Вижте услугите
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white shadow-xl shadow-[#93A5DF]/20 sm:col-span-2">
				<img class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover" src="/images/photos/Galeria/Metaldetector_s1.jpg" alt="Промишлен металдетектор ЗЛАТ в индустриална среда" width="760" height="428" />
			</figure>
			<figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white shadow-lg shadow-[#93A5DF]/10">
				<img class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover" src="/images/photos/Galeria/P1200047.JPG" alt="Металдетектор с транспортна лента" width="360" height="270" loading="lazy" />
			</figure>
			<figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white shadow-lg shadow-[#93A5DF]/10">
				<img class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover" src="/images/photos/Galeria/PC230782.JPG" alt="Гравитачен промишлен металдетектор" width="360" height="270" loading="lazy" />
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
